nsh pull request #835 (https://github.com/longbridge/nsh/pull/835), upstream commit
9fd5700a992320054632a74380142d7591213296 in https://github.com/longbridge/nsh.
Pins QuickJS to 0.14.2, whose interrupted array-find fix prevents a double free.
The upstream regression test is unchanged. Dependency features and unrelated lockfile entries stay as in v0.3.0.

